    "detailed_description": "Experience the Fun with Duels Soccer!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHave you ever played a soccer game that you enjoyed even when you lost? Welcome to Duels Soccer, the fun and engaging game that challenges the traditional rules of soccer, putting you in control in a whole new way!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEnjoy a dynamic and exciting experience where strategy and skill are important, but it's the element of luck and chaos that makes it truly fun. Discover unique ways to play and rethink what you know about how soccer should be enjoyed.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGet ready to explore and master the diverse mechanics of Duels Soccer, where each skill becomes a crucial tool to win and stand out on the field:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWalk, Run, Move Strategically: Control your player with complete freedom, from walking and running to more calculated and slower movements, allowing for a unique strategic approach on the field.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPrecise and Strategic Kicks: The ability to kick is not just about strength but also about accuracy. Each kick defines the fate of the match and requires timing and strategy.",
    "about_the_game": "Experience the Fun with Duels Soccer!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHave you ever played a soccer game that you enjoyed even when you lost? Welcome to Duels Soccer, the fun and engaging game that challenges the traditional rules of soccer, putting you in control in a whole new way!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEnjoy a dynamic and exciting experience where strategy and skill are important, but it's the element of luck and chaos that makes it truly fun. Discover unique ways to play and rethink what you know about how soccer should be enjoyed.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGet ready to explore and master the diverse mechanics of Duels Soccer, where each skill becomes a crucial tool to win and stand out on the field:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWalk, Run, Move Strategically: Control your player with complete freedom, from walking and running to more calculated and slower movements, allowing for a unique strategic approach on the field.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPrecise and Strategic Kicks: The ability to kick is not just about strength but also about accuracy. Each kick defines the fate of the match and requires timing and strategy.",
    "short_description": "Master the Art of Headers and Strategy: Elevate your 2-player matches with precise ball control and headers in Duels Soccer, outsmarting opponents with thrilling, strategic plays.",
